{"id":"3684631419c30fd9","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-maxsatip.md","title":"Integer programming and multilinear Max Sat models","display":"thm-maxsatip — Integer programming and multilinear Max Sat models","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-maxsatip","aliases":["27-thm-maxsatip"],"display":"thm-maxsatip — Integer programming and multilinear Max Sat models","depends_on":["[[27-df-maxsat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.11.4 Theorem 2.26","source_printed_pages":"117","source_pdf_pages":"141","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-maxsatip"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-maxsatip</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-maxsatip — Integer programming and multilinear Max Sat models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.11.4 Theorem 2.26"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"117"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"141"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\">\\(C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"88afb3e9aa26fa43\" href=\"?note=88afb3e9aa26fa43\" title=\"27-df-maxsat\">27-df-maxsat</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\ge1\">\\(n,m\\ge1\\)</span>。连续乘积表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W^*=\\max\\left\\{\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k z_k\\mid(x,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right\\}=\\max_{x\\in[0,1]^n}F(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W^*=\\max\\left\\{\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k z_k\\mid(x,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right\\}=\\max_{x\\in[0,1]^n}F(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对固定二值 x，指标 z_k 可取 1 恰好在 C_k(x)=0 时；正权使最优选择取全部允许的 1。F 在每个坐标分别为仿射函数，因此从任意连续点逐个把坐标移到不减目标的端点，最终得到二值点；这证明连续最大值与离散最大值一致，而不依赖局部最优能求到全局最优的错误假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-maxsat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-maxsat","status":"resolved","id":"88afb3e9aa26fa43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*$ 如 [[27-df-maxsat]]，$n,m\\ge1$。连续乘积表达式 $F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C_k,A_k,B_k,w_k,W,W^*","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"F:[0,1]^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"F(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k\\left(1-\\prod_{i\\in A_k}x_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-x_j)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"W^*=\\max\\left\\{\\sum_{k=1}^m w_k z_k\\mid(x,z)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\land\\forall k\\in[m]\\;z_k\\le\\sum_{i\\in A_k}(1-x_i)+\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right\\}=\\max_{x\\in[0,1]^n}F(x).","display":true}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-maxsatip|thm-maxsatip — Integer programming and multilinear Max Sat models]]"}],"outgoing":["88afb3e9aa26fa43"]}